{"claim": "The camera:dvr tile sizes itself with CSS only: .picture-wrap is full tile width with aspect-ratio set from camera/status (rotation 90/270 swaps it), and the tab bar and active tab content flow under it, so the tile's height follows its content and the first fit equals every later fit.", "detail": "Session 3 C3 (2026-11-06). adjustSizes() no longer measures; it only sets the ratio and returns early before camera/status answers. Refit comes from a per-mount ResizeObserver on ME that disconnects itself when !ME.isConnected (window.resize never fires when the Peers panel is dragged, and window handlers piled up one per remount). Tabs use data-id cam-live/cam-dvr/cam-events so a host page's initNavbar can't flip them.", "tags": "camera,dvr,tile,layout,C3,C2", "source": {"lib": "camera", "ctl": "dvr", "facet": "js", "hash": "ec1928aec87664b9"}, "confidence": "high", "time": 1793967587349},
{"end": true}]
